OL,3,GNEWSAChicken waste plant approved amid
OL,4,Afears over smell
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a biogas plant which will
OL,7,Fconvert 120,000 tonnes of chicken waste
OL,8,Fand feedstock into renewable gas each
OL,9,Fyear have been approved despite
OL,10,Fvillagers' fears about "overwhelming"
OL,11,Fsmells.
OL,13,FStream BioEnergy UK Ltd has been given
OL,14,Fpermission to build on land west of the
OL,15,FMoy Park facility, south of the A153 in
OL,16,FAnwick, near Sleaford.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,386,380,200,160,0,100
