OL,3,GNEWSAChicken waste plant approved amid
OL,4,Afears over smell
OL,5,
OL,6,FLincolnshire County Council planning
OL,7,Fofficers recommended councillors refuse
OL,8,Fthe proposals, saying there would be
OL,9,F"substantial harm to heritage assets"
OL,10,Fin the area - and residents said their
OL,11,Fhealth was being ignored.
OL,13,FBut the planning committee said the
OL,14,F"public benefits" would outweigh the
OL,15,Fdisadvantages and pointed to the extra
OL,16,Fjobs and benefits to the local economy.
